Parity disposition: the web <Combobox> is a generic <T> "type to filter then pick" primitive. Its hooks
are useTranslation / useAnnouncer / useId — NO React-Query, NO fetch beyond its own async `options`
loader. REAL source branches reproduced: in-flight loading row + inline spinner (web `loading` /
`asyncLoading`), "No results" empty row, populated list with active-descendant + selected highlight,
"{{count}} more — refine search" overflow footer, clear (×) + chevron, free-text commit, disabled,
result-count live-region announce. The async loader's reject folds to [] in the web; this surface, like
the in-tree forms sibling UnitInput (0162), ADDS the P4 leaf contract so the field never collapses to a
blank box: an explicit error retry row (the QueryError peer of the swallowed loader failure) + the
orthogonal stale/offline freshness axis (chip + one-shot stale auto-refresh). No web Tailwind class is
ported; layout uses P1/S9 tokens. Charts/maps: NONE in source → none here.

